extraction_failed.description:
Extracting the static GTFS data of datasource '{datasource}' failed:

{error}

The previous data of this datasource, if there is any, is still in use. GTFS2 retries a failed extraction once by itself, 15 minutes after it failed. If this message stays, fix the source and run the 'gtfs2.update_gtfs' action for this datasource, or remove the datasource and add it again.
